---
layout: layouts/rearrange.njk
pagination:
  data: rearrangeEdition.scenes
  size: 1
  alias: scene
permalink: "/stories/rearrange/{{ scene.slug }}/index.html"
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ scene.title }}"
  description: "{{ scene.question }}"
---
<article class="edition-scene" data-story-node="{{ scene.slug }}" data-movement="{{ scene.movement }}" style="--movement-color: {{ scene.movementInfo.color }}">
  <div class="scene-sky" aria-hidden="true"><div class="cosmos-stars"></div><div class="scene-orbit"></div></div>
  <header class="scene-hero shell">
    <div class="scene-route"><a href="{{ '/stories/rearrange/' | relativeUrl(page.url) }}">← 返回星图</a><span>{{ scene.movementInfo.number }} / Ⅲ · {{ scene.movementInfo.title }}</span><span>{{ scene.number }} / 15</span></div>
    <p class="scene-symbol" aria-hidden="true">{{ scene.movementInfo.symbol }}</p><p class="scene-era">{{ scene.era }} · {{ scene.movementInfo.english }}</p>
    <h1>{{ scene.title }}</h1><p class="scene-question">{{ scene.question }}</p><p class="scene-lead">{{ scene.lead }}</p>
    <div class="scene-scroll-cue">往下读，线索会在故事中打开 <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></div>
  </header>
  <div class="scene-reading-shell shell">
    <aside class="scene-rail" aria-label="阅读进度"><div class="scene-rail-inner"><p>READING / {{ scene.number }}</p><span>{{ scene.movementInfo.title }}</span><div class="scene-rail-rule" aria-hidden="true"></div><small>{{ scene.question }}</small><div class="scene-rail-progress" data-scene-progress>01 / {{ scene.narrative.paragraphs.length }}</div></div></aside>
    <div class="scene-reading scene-narrative">
      {% for paragraph in scene.narrative.paragraphs %}
      <p data-fragment>{{ paragraph }}</p>
      {% if loop.index == scene.narrative.hingeAfter %}
      <aside class="crossing" aria-label="交叉线索"><div class="crossing-glyph" aria-hidden="true">✧</div><div><p>另一条路在这里交会</p><h3>{{ scene.crossing.label }}</h3><span>{{ scene.crossing.note }}</span></div><a href="{{ ('/stories/rearrange/' ~ scene.crossing.to ~ '/') | relativeUrl(page.url) }}" aria-label="{{ scene.crossing.label }}：{{ scene.crossTitle }}">前往 {{ scene.crossTitle }} ↗</a></aside>
      {% endif %}{% endfor %}
      <details class="source-note"><summary>这段故事从哪里来？</summary><p>这段叙事依据原书不同位置的内容重写并串联。以下是主要来源页码；不确定之处仍以原书材料为界。</p><ul>{% for passage in scene.passages %}<li>书页 {{ passage.page }} · {{ passage.title }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul></details>
    </div>
  </div>
  <section class="scene-exit"><div class="shell scene-exit-inner"><div class="scene-exit-heading"><p class="eyebrow">THE STORY CONTINUES</p><h2>同一片星空，<br>还有别的走法。</h2><p>下一站沿着当前线前进；另一站从刚才的线索进入别的视角。</p></div><div class="scene-exit-routes"><a class="route-primary" href="{{ ('/stories/rearrange/' ~ scene.next ~ '/') | relativeUrl(page.url) }}"><span>沿 {{ scene.movementInfo.title }} 继续</span><strong>{{ scene.nextTitle }}</strong><b>→</b></a><a class="route-secondary" href="{{ ('/stories/rearrange/' ~ scene.crossing.to ~ '/') | relativeUrl(page.url) }}"><span>在交叉处转向</span><strong>{{ scene.crossTitle }}</strong><b>↗</b></a><a class="route-map" href="{{ '/stories/rearrange/' | relativeUrl(page.url) }}">回到星图，选择任意一站</a></div></div></section>
</article>
